# Superselection-sector formalization boundary

The former contents of this module consisted of placeholder structures and
`True` theorems. They did not formalize DHR sectors, a braided fusion category,
topological-order stability, or anyon braiding, so those declarations have
been removed rather than retained as purported results.

The repository's finite toric-code matrix calculations are owned by
`InfoGeometry.Canonical.QuantumDoubleToricCodeBridge`. This module does not
claim those finite calculations establish the DHR classification theorem.
The DHR construction remains open until its observable net, localized
endomorphisms, transportability, and braiding are represented by actual Lean
objects and proved laws.
